DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       mmkkffss..bbffss creates an SCO bfs filesystem on a block device (usually a
       disk partition or a file accessed via the loop device).

       The _b_l_o_c_k_-_c_o_u_n_t parameter is the desired size of the filesystem, in
       blocks. If nothing is specified, the entire partition will be used.

