       --NN, ----iinnooddeess _n_u_m_b_e_r
           Specify the desired _n_u_m_b_e_r of inodes (at most 512). If nothing is
           specified, some default number in the range 48-512 is picked
           depending on the size of the partition.

       --VV, ----vvnnaammee _l_a_b_e_l
           Specify the volume _l_a_b_e_l. I have no idea if/where this is used.

       --FF, ----ffnnaammee _n_a_m_e
           Specify the filesystem _n_a_m_e. I have no idea if/where this is used.

       --vv, ----vveerrbboossee
           Explain what is being done.

       --cc
           This option is silently ignored.

       --ll
           This option is silently ignored.

