           Display help text and exit.

       --VV, ----vveerrssiioonn
           Print version and exit. Option --VV only works as ----vveerrssiioonn when it
           is the only option.

EEXXIITT SSTTAATTUUSS
       The exit status returned by mmkkffss..bbffss is 0 when all went well, and 1
       when something went wrong.

